flowchart LR
  C[Customer / staff] --> B
  subgraph Browser[Browser client]
    B[React 19 + TypeScript dashboard<br/>Overview, Agent, CRM, Appointments,<br/>Knowledge, Analytics, Settings]
    V[Web Speech API<br/>SpeechRecognition + speechSynthesis]
    B <--> V
  end
  B -->|JSON over same-origin /api| EDGE
  subgraph Edge[HTTP edge]
    EDGE[Vite proxy in development<br/>or Nginx in Docker]
  end
  EDGE --> API
  subgraph Backend[FastAPI backend]
    API[REST routers + Pydantic validation]
    STREAM[Exotel AgentStream WebSocket bridge<br/>Basic Auth + PCM audio]
    AGENT[SalesAgent orchestrator<br/>deterministic planner]
    TOOLS[10 validated tools<br/>audit log]
    SVC[Business services<br/>extraction, sentiment, scoring,<br/>scheduling, summaries]
    RAG[Knowledge retrieval<br/>BM25 + optional embeddings]
    API --> AGENT
    AGENT --> TOOLS
    TOOLS --> SVC
    TOOLS --> RAG
  end
  TOOLS --> DB[(SQLAlchemy ORM<br/>SQLite default<br/>13 tables)]
  RAG --> DB
  SVC --> DB
  AGENT -. optional grounded text / embeddings .-> LLM[Gemini / Grok REST<br/>or local Ollama<br/>demo templates available]
  PHONE[Caller] --> EXO[Exotel ExoPhone<br/>App Bazaar + Voicebot flow]
  EXO <-->|bidirectional WSS audio| STREAM
  STREAM <-->|16 kHz linear16 audio / transcript| SARVAM[Sarvam realtime STT + TTS]
  STREAM -->|final transcript| AGENT
  STREAM -. external account, number and public WSS required .-> API
  DB -. future migration / operations .-> FUTURE[PostgreSQL, Redis,<br/>background workers, auth<br/>production roadmap only]
